---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy - Teacher Jake" 
  currentLang="english" 
  currentTag="all"
  description="Learn about how we protect student privacy and handle data at Teacher Jake."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-white p-8 md:p-12 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 mt-8 mb-12 px-4 sm:px-8 md:px-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#06422f] mb-8 tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-emerald max-w-none text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-serif">
      <p class="text-lg mb-6">At Teacher Jake, we take student privacy seriously. We designed our tools to be learning-focused without unnecessary tracking or data collection.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-10 mb-4 font-sans">1. Voice Recordings</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">Any voice recordings made during speaking and pronunciation activities are stored entirely <strong>locally on your device</strong> (such as your phone, tablet, or computer). These audio files are <strong>never</strong> sent to, processed by, or stored on our servers.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-10 mb-4 font-sans">2. Student Results & Progress</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">By default, individual results, scores, and activity progress are not tracked or saved by our application in any database.</p>
      <p class="mb-4">The only exception is if a student enters a specific <strong>teacher code</strong> on a quiz. When a valid teacher code is provided and the quiz is submitted, the results are sent directly to that specific teacher's secure Google Sheet for grading purposes.</p>
      <p class="mb-6">Otherwise, students must show their generated "Report Card" directly to their teacher in person, or take a screenshot of their results, as this data is not stored off the device.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-10 mb-4 font-sans">3. Website Analytics</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">We use cookie-free, privacy-friendly basic analytics strictly to measure overall anonymous page views and understand which worksheets and learning tools are most helpful. We do not use analytics to track individual users, identify students, or follow anyone across the web.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-10 mb-4 font-sans">4. Google Ads & Third-Party Cookies</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">We display advertisements served by Google AdSense to help support the ongoing development of learning materials on this site.</p>
      <p class="mb-4">To serve personalized ads, third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to show ads based on a user's prior visits to our website or other websites on the Internet.</p>
      <p class="mb-4">Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to our users based on their visits to this site and/or other sites on the Internet.</p>
      <p class="mb-6">You can customize your preferences or opt out of personalized advertising entirely in the following ways:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Opt out of personalized Google Ads directly by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-700 hover:underline">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
        <li>Opt out of third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting the <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-700 hover:underline">AboutAds.info</a> opt-out portal.</li>
        <li>Use the <a href="http://optout.networkadvertising.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-700 hover:underline">Network Advertising Initiative</a> opt-out tool to manage advertising preferences.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-10 mb-4 font-sans">5. Managing Cookie Consent</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">When you first visit our site, you will see a cookie consent banner allowing you to Accept All, Decline All, or customize your preferences for essential, analytics, or marketing cookies.</p>
      <p class="mb-6">You can change or revoke your consent preferences at any time. Simply <a href="#" class="open-cookie-settings text-emerald-700 font-semibold hover:underline">click here to manage your cookie preferences</a> to open the preferences dashboard and adjust your choices.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
